.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Provides a Fibonacci‑based search strategy for containers implementing \fBIContainer<T>\fP\&. 

Fibonacci search is an alternative to binary search that uses decreasing Fibonacci intervals to narrow the search space\&. It is particularly suited for sorted containers and scenarios where comparison operations are more expensive than index arithmetic\&.

.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIT\fP The element type stored in the container\&. 
.br
\fITContainer\fP The container type being searched\&. Must implement \fBIVector<T>\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP
