.SS "long SystemEx\&.Algorithms\&.FibonacciSearcherProvider< T, TContainer >\&.Find (ref TContainer container, ICompared< T > comp, T value)"

.PP
Searches the container for elements matching \fIvalue\fP  using a Fibonacci search strategy and a comparison provider\&. The search iteratively reduces the interval size using Fibonacci numbers, comparing elements at calculated probe positions until the target value is found or the search space is exhausted\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIcontainer\fP The container to search\&. Passed by reference to avoid copying\&. 
.br
\fIcomp\fP The comparison provider used to evaluate the relation between container elements and the target value\&. 
.br
\fIvalue\fP The value to search for, wrapped in \fBOptional<T>\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The number of matches found\&. 
.br
 Typically \fR0\fP or \fR1\fP for strictly ordered containers\&. 
.RE
.PP

